### 6.2 NarrativeStructure (DAG — Zone A output)

```python
# backend/schemas/narrative.py

from pydantic import BaseModel
from typing import Optional, List, Dict

class NarrativeStructure(BaseModel):
    """
    11-field structured representation of user input.
    Implements the Situational Structure Model (SSM).
    Built from distilled text — never contains raw PII.
    Used for: thread map updates, Zone C context (anonymized only).
    """

    # SSM Layer 1: Event Structure
    trigger_domain: str           # work | family | romantic | social | internal | ambiguous
    primary_actors: List[str]     # Placeholder IDs only ["PERSON_A", "PERSON_B"]
    action_taken: Optional[str]   # What the user did (distilled)
    action_desired: Optional[str] # What the user wanted to do (distilled)
    outcome: Optional[str]        # What happened as result (distilled)

    # SSM Layer 2: Constraint Field (6 continuous dimensions 0.0-1.0)
    freedom_to_refuse: float      # How much user felt they could say no
    conflict_cost: float          # Perceived cost of conflict in this situation
    relationship_risk: float      # Perceived risk to relationship
    expectation_pressure: float   # External expectations bearing on situation
    agency_score: float           # Overall perceived agency (derived)
    social_exposure: float        # How exposed/witnessed the user felt

    # SSM Layer 3: Internal Reaction
    primary_emotion_label: str    # Non-diagnostic: hollow | tense | heavy | numb etc.
    body_location: Optional[str]  # Where user feels it (if mentioned)
    reaction_pattern: str         # suppress | express | withdraw | confront | freeze

    # SSM Layer 4: Meaning-Making
    attributed_cause: Optional[str]  # What user believes caused this (distilled)
    self_narrative: Optional[str]    # How user narrates their own role (distilled)

    # SSM Layer 5: Temporal Pattern
    first_occurrence: bool        # Is this the first time or recurring?
    pattern_descriptor: Optional[str]  # "always when X", "every time Y" (distilled)

    # SSM Layer 6: Resolution Attempt
    resolution_tried: Optional[str]   # What user attempted (distilled)
    resolution_outcome: Optional[str] # Whether it worked

    # DAG edges (causal links between fields)
    causal_chain: List[Dict]     # [{"from": "trigger", "to": "reaction", "type": "causes"}]
```

